# AI-DLC engine copies are regenerated in every checkout (docs/design/aidlc-include.md §2): only settings.json and skills/sds-audit/ are tracked.
# This allowlist also covers the per-stage runner skills (skills/aidlc-*/) that §2b's list does not name; the pull request states the deviation.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/sds-audit/
# AI-DLC audit records are not committed to this public repository (iyasaka-arc#49 6354411741).
aidlc/spaces/*/intents/*/audit/
